From b0ff00c98e020e719651d7d563b931a1a6783fba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:06:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: add chrome://aegis WebUI and module prefs

Expose tracker/phish/fingerprint toggles via chrome://aegis, persist
prefs, and sync tracker blocking to renderers through DynamicParams.
---

